<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="OBA" style="id">Obadiah</book>
  <para style="h">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Obadiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Obadiah mengmuna Mangpa Pasian in Edom tungtang tambangin agen hi: Mangpa akipata thu hing tung khat ka za ua, tualeh namte lah ah thupotu khat akisawl a, ama’n “Kisa un, Kidouna ah ama dou dingin ikuon dinguh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai vawi, Keima’n namte lah a neunoukhat in ka hing bawl dinga, nasatah a simmaw na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lungtang kiletsahna in nang ahing solta hi; Nang kawlsuong kawm lah a tengpa, nang asanna munte a tengpa, “Koi ahiei leilah a kei hing kaikhe suh ding?” na lungtanga chipa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang leh nang muvanlai bangin, kitawisangtou nanlachin zong, aasite lah ah na bu sep nanlachin, khuna pat in hing kaikhe suh veve ding ka hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gutate na kungah hing pei u’henlen, zanlai in suomhatte hing pei taleh, bangzata a suhsiet na hita diei! adei zaza uh aguh masangsie uh, agu sih ding uh amah? Grepga khawmte na kung ah hing peita u’leh, Grep sang maimai hing nuasielou ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangchidan a Esau kisuidoh ding ahiei mah? bangchidan a agou phuolguhte mudoh ahiei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pankhawmpite zousie in, gamgi dong ahing notdoh ding ua, Kilemtah a na umpi miten nang ahing sol ding ua, ahing zouta ding uhi; Na tanghou nete’n na awhna ding thang akam ding ua, ama uah theisiemna a um mawngmawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Edom mipilte nangawn ka sumang in, theisiemna neite khu Esau muolte a kipat, ka subei sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Aw Teman, Esau muol a mi chinteng tha a sattan ahitheina dingun, na mihatte alungke ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na sanggampa Jakob tung a na hiemngapna ziehin zumna in ahing khu ding a, kumtawna satkhiehin na umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lelampanga na din ni chiengin Gamdang mite’n, agalkapte sal a apuimang pieh ni chieng a, Gamdang mite akulkotpi a alut a, Jerusalem tunga ai asan chiengun, Nang nangawn zong alah ua khat bang na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh na sanggampa sal a pui ahi lai ni a, na awi ding ahi sih a, Juda tate suhmang a a um ni un zong, na kipah ding ahisih hi. Alungkham mangbat ni chiengun zong, kiliensahtah in thu gen sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Avangsiet ni un Kamite kulkotpi a na lut lou ding ahi, avangsiet ni un agimthuohna uh na en sih dinga, avangsiet ni ua, anei alamsa tung ua na khut na hahlou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alah ua suohta taidohte sattan dinga, lamkathuom a na din ding ahisih a; alungkhamna ni ua suohta umsunte, galte khut a na piehkhiet ding ahisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa ni khu nam zousie tungah anaita hi; na bawl bangbangin na tungah akibawl dinga, na silbawlte mama nangma lutungah atu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen ka muol siengthou tunga na dawn bangin, nam zousie ten adawn ding uhi, adawn ding ua, aval ding uhi, tualeh a um ngailou bangin amang den ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Zion muol ah hutkhietna a um ding a, Khunah sienthouna aum ding hi; Khunah Jakob innkuonte’n agouluo uh atangta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakob innkuonte mei ahi ding ua, Joseph innkuonte meikuong ahi ding uh, hinanleh Esau innkuonte pen, bukungbul gaw ahi ding uhi; Jakob in Esau akaa dinga, akatum ding hi. Esau innkuonte koima asuohta a um sih ding hi; aziehpen Mangpa’n agensa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simlam a teng miten Esau muol atang ding ua, Tualeh phaijang gam a a teng miten, Philistin a tang ding ua; Ephraim lougamte leh, Samaria lougamte aluo ding ua, Benjamin in Gilead aluo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate lah a saltang Halah gam a umten, Kanaan mite gam Zarephath dongin aluo ding uhi. Jerusalem mi Shapharad a saltanga umten, Simlam khopi aluo ding ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Esau muola vaihawm dingin, hunkhemite Zion muol ah akaltou ding ua, tualeh leenggam khu Mangpa a ahita ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
